12.terraform init
Run: terraform init
Purpose: Initializes the terraform working directory and downloads required provider 
plugins/modules

After terraform init,
.terraform/
    -->download working directory dependencies/provider artifacts
.terraform.lock.hcl
    -->dependency lock information
13.terraform fmt
Run: terraform fmt
Purpose: Formats terraform configuration into canonical style

Example bad format:
resource "aws_vpc" "main" {cidr_block="10.0.0.0/16"}
terraform fmt formats it appropriately

14.terraform validate
Run: terraform validate
purpose: Checks whether the terraform configuration is internally valid

Output: Success! The configuration is valid

